<section class="page-shell page-about">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our Story</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Over 100 years of distribution experience.</h1>
    <p class="page-lead">Family owned since 1921, Price Wholesale Distribution has built its business on dependable service, quality brands and long-term relationships with the businesses we serve.</p>

    <div class="about-intro">
      <div class="about-year">1921</div>
      <div>
        <h2>Four generations. One family business.</h2>
        <p>For more than a century, Price Wholesale Distribution has been part of the wholesale food and beverage business. What started in 1921 has grown into a family-owned distribution operation serving businesses throughout the Baltimore and Washington market.</p>
        <p>We focus on the products our customers need, the service they can count on and the relationships that keep their businesses moving.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-values">
      <div>
        <strong>QUALITY BRANDS</strong>
        <p>Recognizable products from brands customers know and trust.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>RELIABLE SERVICE</strong>
        <p>Wholesale distribution built around dependable delivery and customer service.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>LOCAL EXPERIENCE</strong>
        <p>More than a century of family-owned experience serving the Baltimore and Washington market.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-next">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Work With Us</p>
        <h2>Looking for a dependable wholesale distributor?</h2>
        <p>Tell us about your business and we'll help determine whether Price Wholesale Distribution is a good fit for your operation.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/pages/become-a-customer">Become a Customer</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-next { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:40px; margin-top:70px; padding:38px; background:var(--navy); color:var(--white); }
  .about-next h2 { margin:0 0 8px; color:var(--white); font-size:32px; line-height:1.1; }
  .about-next p:not(.eyebrow) { margin:0; max-width:700px; color:#dbe5ef; }
  .about-next .eyebrow { margin-bottom:8px; }
  .about-next .btn { flex:0 0 auto; background:var(--white); color:var(--navy); }
  .about-next .btn:hover { background:#e9eef4; }
  @media (max-width:640px) { .about-next { flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-start; margin-top:55px; padding:28px; } .about-next h2 { font-size:28px; } }
</style>

